This project is a Windows port of Mac-Remover, which is distributed under the
MIT license:

    https://github.com/Drew1811266/Mac-Remover

Its user interface and inpainting/temporal logic are the origin of the code in
`desktop/renderer/` and `engine/pipeline/`.

Third-party components keep their own licenses:

    LaMa             Apache-2.0   https://github.com/advimman/lama
    Real-ESRGAN      BSD-3-Clause https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN
    SeedVR2 runtime  see upstream https://github.com/numz/ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler
    FFmpeg (GPL)     GPL          https://ffmpeg.org/legal.html

The bundled ffmpeg build is GPL, which makes the distributed binaries subject
to the GPL. The build used and how it is obtained are recorded in
`docs/adr/0004-ffmpeg-distribution.md`.
